    "m_SourceType": 0,
    "m_FunctionName": "GetShadow",
    "m_FunctionSource": "d63bbef5c3a5a2947b64dac9c4b8d798",
    "m_FunctionSourceUsePragmas": true,
    "m_FunctionBody": "#if defined(SHADERGRAPH_PREVIEW)\n    Shadow = 1;\n#else\n    float4 sc = TransformWorldToShadowCoord(WorldPos);\n    Light l = GetMainLight(sc);\n    Shadow = l.shadowAttenuation;\n#endif\n```\n\nBranche un node **Position** (mode World) → `WorldPos`.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Brancher dans le graph\n```\n[Position (World)] → [Custom Function: GetShadow] → Shadow (Float)\n                                                          ↓\n                                              [Multiply] ← ta couleur / albedo\n                                                          ↓\n                                                    [Base Color]"
}

